<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    The Smart Community Portal (“SCP”, “we”, “our”, or “us”) is committed to protecting your privacy and handling personal information responsibly in accordance with the Australian Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs). By using this portal, you consent to the collection and use of your information as described here. We may collect personal details such as your name, email address, and contact information when you register or use our services, along with technical data like IP address, browser type, and usage statistics to improve user experience. This information is used to provide and manage community services, process bookings and feedback, send important notifications, and ensure system performance and compliance with local government standards. Your information will not be sold or shared for marketing purposes, but may be disclosed to authorized staff, service providers, or government bodies when required by law, all of whom are expected to uphold equivalent privacy protections. Data is stored securely with appropriate safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, although no online system can guarantee absolute security. The portal may use cookies and analytics tools to support features, track performance, and enhance usability; users can disable cookies in their browser settings, but this may affect site functionality. You have the right to access and correct your personal information by contacting our support team. While we may include links to external websites, we are not responsible for their content or privacy practices. This policy may be updated periodically to reflect operational or legal changes, and the latest version will always be available on this page. For privacy inquiries or requests, please contact the Smart Community Portal team via email at support@smartcommunityportal.local
    or by mail at CityLink Initiatives, Perth, Western Australia.
</p>
